<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Labirinto da Tabuada: Missão dos Campeões | Guia & Jogo | Lab Kids</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Jogo arcade de labirinto estilo Pac-Man com desafios de multiplicação e cálculo mental para 2º ao 5º ano do Ensino Fundamental.">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=4">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;600;700&family=Outfit:wght@400;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Google AdSense Official Script -->
    <script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=<%= adsensePubId %>" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <style>
        body { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #090d16 0%, #1e1b4b 100%); 
            color: #f8fafc; 
            font-family: 'Fredoka', system-ui, sans-serif; 
            min-height: 100vh; 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 20px 10px 60px 10px; 
        }
        .container-presentation { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .top-nav { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 25px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px; }
        .btn-return-portal { 
            display: inline-flex; 
            align-items: center; 
            gap: 8px; 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #dc2626); 
            color: white; 
            padding: 12px 24px; 
            border-radius: 50px; 
            font-weight: 800; 
            text-decoration: none; 
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4); 
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); 
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-return-portal:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .hero-banner { 
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9); 
            border: 2px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); 
            border-radius: 28px; 
            padding: 35px 25px; 
            text-align: center; 
            margin-bottom: 30px; 
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 0 30px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); 
            position: relative; 
            overflow: hidden; 
        }
        .hero-badge { 
            display: inline-block; 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #facc15, #ea580c); 
            color: #0f172a; 
            font-weight: 800; 
            font-size: 0.85rem; 
            padding: 6px 16px; 
            border-radius: 50px; 
            margin-bottom: 12px; 
            text-transform: uppercase; 
            letter-spacing: 1px; 
        }
        .game-title { 
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); 
            font-weight: 800; 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #facc15, #38bdf8); 
            -webkit-background-clip: text; 
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; 
            margin: 8px 0; 
        }
        .btn-launch-large { 
            display: inline-flex; 
            align-items: center; 
            gap: 12px; 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669); 
            color: white; 
            padding: 18px 45px; 
            border-radius: 50px; 
            font-size: 1.4rem; 
            font-weight: 800; 
            text-decoration: none; 
            margin-top: 20px; 
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5); 
            border: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4); 
            transition: transform 0.2s; 
            animation: pulse 2s infinite; 
        }
        .btn-launch-large:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }
        @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); } 50% { transform: scale(1.03); } }
        .pedagogical-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .card-pedagogical { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 20px; padding: 25px; }
        .bncc-badge { background: #6366f1; color: white; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; display: inline-block; margin: 4px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container-presentation">
        <div class="top-nav">
            <a href="/" class="btn-return-portal">⬅️ VOLTAR AO PORTAL</a>
            <span style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #cbd5e1;">🤖 Lab Kids • Jogos de Matemática</span>
        </div>

        <!-- AdSense Top Banner -->
        <div class="adsense-tablet-wrapper">
            <span class="adsense-micro-label">PUBLICIDADE</span>
            <div class="adsense-box">
                <ins class="adsbygoogle tablet-ad-banner"
                     style="display:block; text-align:center;"
                     data-ad-layout="in-article"
                     data-ad-format="horizontal"
                     data-ad-client="<%= adsensePubId %>"
                     data-ad-slot="1234567890"></ins>
                <script>
                     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});
                </script>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-banner">
            <div class="hero-badge">⚽ ARCADE MATEMÁTICO BNCC</div>
            <h1 class="game-title">Labirinto da Tabuada: Missão dos Campeões</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: #cbd5e1; max-width: 700px; margin: 10px auto; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;">
                Inspirado nos clássicos arcades e no Blinky's Maze, pilote o Robô Bit pelo estádio neon, resolva multiplicações em tempo real e capture a bola com o resultado certo enquanto foge dos cronômetros malucos!
            </p>
            
            <a href="/games/labirinto-tabuada/index.html" class="btn-launch-large">
                🎮 JOGAR AGORA! 🚀
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="pedagogical-grid">
            <div class="card-pedagogical">
                <h3 style="color: #38bdf8;">📌 Ficha Pedagógica</h3>
                <p><strong>Público-Alvo:</strong> 2º ao 5º Ano do Ensino Fundamental</p>
                <p><strong>Conteúdo:</strong> Multiplicação, Cálculo Mental e Agilidade</p>
                <p><strong>Controles:</strong> Teclado (Setas / WASD) e D-Pad Virtual Touch para tablets</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card-pedagogical">
                <h3 style="color: #a855f7;">📘 Habilidades BNCC</h3>
                <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Alinhamento com o currículo de Matemática:</p>
                <div>
                    <span class="bncc-badge">EF02MA07</span>
                    <span class="bncc-badge">EF03MA07</span>
                    <span class="bncc-badge">EF04MA05</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- AdSense Bottom Banner -->
        <div class="adsense-tablet-wrapper">
            <span class="adsense-micro-label">PUBLICIDADE</span>
            <div class="adsense-box">
                <ins class="adsbygoogle tablet-ad-banner"
                     style="display:block; text-align:center;"
                     data-ad-layout="in-article"
                     data-ad-format="horizontal"
                     data-ad-client="<%= adsensePubId %>"
                     data-ad-slot="1234567890"></ins>
                <script>
                     (adsbygoogle = window.adsbygoogle || []).push({});
                </script>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
